<title>USA: Hvide Jun 30 Q2 net profit up to $260,000.</title>
<headline>Hvide Jun 30 Q2 net profit up to $260,000.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net     profit  $260	    loss   $(144)</p>
<p> Revs		21,540		   16,668</p>
<p>	   6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Net     profit  $226	    loss   $(753)</p>
<p> Revs		41,751		   32,448</p>
<p>(All data above 000s) NOTE: Full company name is Hvide Marine Corp. The company said in the energy support business was strong in the second quarter. Revenues from the energy transport business grew 21 percent from last year, helped by the colder winter and higher natural gas prices, it said.</p>
</text>
